  "bodyText": "NODEROOM CODEBASE TRACE\n\nPortable trace UI for agent apps.\n\nSQLite trace session, proof cards, events, and gated ownership were generated locally.\n\nInspect trace\nnpm run nodetrace:happy-path\nno API key required\nSQLITE SAMPLE\nVERIFIED\nSQLite\nNodeRoom trace\nbrowser UI\nSource app\nNodeRoom\nSQLite sample\nCoach steps\n0\nordered labels\nTrace tabs\n4\noverview, steps, minimap, raw\nThe SQLite sample contains trace events. No Trace Coach captures are loaded yet.\nConnect your own trace\n\nThis installed sample contains trace events. Guided source and UI captures are not included. Run npm run nodetrace:happy-path to regenerate the local sample and refresh. Read docs/NODETRACE_INTEGRATION.md in your project to connect the trace UI to your app.\n\nLive graph rail\n10 entities from 4 SQLite trace events. Trace events render as interaction history — faint constant-width traversal edges, never evidence.\nEntity\nChoose an entity\nactor: nodetrace\ntool: workSurface.traceStrip\nstep: schema\ntool: workSurface.evidenceCarousel\nartifact: demo-artifact\nstep: proof\ntool: copilot.agentOperationStream\nstep: events\ntool: shell.statusStrip\nstep: state\nChoose an entity for its full name and producing events. Canvas labels shorten or hide to avoid overlap.\nRelationship graph\n\n10 entities · 15 of 15 relationships shown\n\nfit\ntraversal\n(15)\n· local\nStatus\n\nSystem health, credential state, run status, and review outcome.\n\nBUSINESS PROOF\nNo provider lock-in\nverified\n\nThe happy path creates local SQLite rows and client state without any model provider or cloud account.\n\nscripts/init-sqlite.mjs - 99%\nSource opening is unavailable in this host.\nRUNTIME TRACE\nSTATE\nPublished client-safe trace state JSON\nnodetrace - 11ms\nCODE OWNERSHIP\n\nBuilder access only. Component, query, mutation, skill, and test ownership must come from a privileged server route."
